Package: seqdesk.explore
Type: Package
Title: Helpers for SeqDesk Flow Steps Written in R
Version: 0.2.0
Description: Reads the inputs a SeqDesk Flow step was given and writes its
    tables, figures, values, notes and data ledger to the run folder's
    outputs/manifest.json, with the same contract as the Python helper
    seqdesk_explore.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: ggplot2, svglite, testthat
